<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Georg Fischer.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Georg Fischer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued two million American-style call warrants on the Georg Fischer bearer shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p>Twenty warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1400 CHF		  PREMIUM	14.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.3 CHF		   GEARING	10.6 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 26.NOV.96-19.JUN.98   PAYDATE	25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1330 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
